<title>USA: Schlumberger China card plant in milestone.</title>
<headline>Schlumberger China card plant in milestone.</headline>
<dateline>MOORESTOWN, N.J. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schlumberger Ltd's electronic transactions unit said on Tuesday its joint-venture smart care and payphone plant in China shipped its one millionth card at the end of January, after two months in production.</p>
<p>Payphone production at the plant in Hunan has reached 1,000 units per month, the company said. The plant is a joint venture with Hunan Post &amp; Telecom Administration.</p>
</text>
